  "body": {
    "id": "prop:equality-frontier",
    "kind": "proposition",
    "statement": "For either \\(b^{\\mathrm{cmp}}\\in\\{b^{\\mathrm{OVS}},b^{\\mathrm{const}}\\}\\),\n\\[\n\\operatorname{Var}_P\\{b^{\\mathrm{cmp}\\prime}\\Psi_P(O)\\}-V_{\\mathrm{agg}}\n=E_P[(b^{\\mathrm{cmp}}-b^\\star(X))'\\Gamma_P(X)(b^{\\mathrm{cmp}}-b^\\star(X))].\n\\tag{E1}\n\\]\nIts losses relative to the localized and published bounds are, respectively,\n\\[\n\\operatorname{Var}_P\\{b^{\\mathrm{cmp}\\prime}\\Psi_P(O)\\}-V_{\\mathrm{can}}\n=E_P[(b^{\\mathrm{cmp}}-b^\\star)'\\Gamma_P(b^{\\mathrm{cmp}}-b^\\star)]\n+\\Delta_{\\mathrm{normal}}(P),\n\\tag{E2}\n\\]\n\\[\n\\Delta_{\\mathrm{cmp}}(P)\n=\\operatorname{Var}_P\\{b^{\\mathrm{cmp}\\prime}\\Psi_P(O)\\}-V_{\\mathrm{OVS}}\n=E_P[(b^{\\mathrm{cmp}}-b^\\star)'\\Gamma_P(b^{\\mathrm{cmp}}-b^\\star)]\n+\\Delta_{\\mathrm{normal}}(P)+\\Delta_{\\mathrm{model}}(P).\n\\tag{E3}\n\\]\nEquality with the aggregate score-family optimum holds if and only if\n\\[\nN'\\Gamma_P(X)b^{\\mathrm{cmp}}=0\n\\quad P_X\\text{-almost surely}.\n\\tag{E4}\n\\]\nEquality with the localized-model bound holds if and only if\n\\[\nE_P[Z_P^{\\mathrm{per}}\\{b^{\\mathrm{cmp}\\prime}\\Psi_P\\}\\mid X]=0\n\\quad P_X\\text{-almost surely},\n\\tag{E5}\n\\]\nand equality with the published OVS bound holds if and only if\n\\[\nE_P[Z_P^{\\mathrm{OVS}}\\{b^{\\mathrm{cmp}\\prime}\\Psi_P\\}\\mid X]=0\n\\quad P_X\\text{-almost surely}.\n\\tag{E6}\n\\]\nThus the three residuals in Definition \\(\\ref{def:projection-diagnostic}\\) answer three distinct projection questions.",
